    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.poster.avif?t=1751653386\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.webm?t=1751653386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.mp4?t=1751653386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Forklift Certified</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>GET READY TO BE CERTIFIED!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Forklift Certified</i>, a unique single-player 3D top-down puzzle experience where you can kick back, unwind, and enjoy clever challenges at your own pace. Take control of a forklift to navigate intricate puzzles, activate mechanisms, and conquer challenges in 10 handcrafted levels, each set in a distinct and creative environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Engaging Forklift-Based Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your forklift to interact with the environment: activate buttons, flip switches, and deliver puzzle pieces to their correct locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>10 Handcrafted Levels Across Unique Locations</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles in diverse environments, from an industrial trainyard to the relaxing farm, through a mysterious dungeon, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Exciting Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial Mode:</strong> Race against the clock to beat bronze, silver, or gold times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel Mode:</strong> Keep your forklift running by collecting gas cans as you navigate each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Pickup Mode:</strong> The forklift's hydraulics are running low, limiting the number of objects you can pick up per level. Strategize carefully!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc4 <strong>Find the Certification Manual Pages</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level features a hidden certification manual page waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f <strong>Certifications</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress and achievements with a variety of certifications to complete. Can you become fully forklift certified?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Custom Forklift Skins</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and equip a variety of fun and quirky forklift designs to personalize your ride.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Immersive Audio &amp; Visuals</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cel-shaded graphics and a dynamic soundtrack that create a calming and engaging atmosphere.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.poster.avif?t=1751653386\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.webm?t=1751653386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3364470/extras/1464422078fcf43e4d9eaac7d8f59c1d.mp4?t=1751653386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Forklift Certified</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>GET READY TO BE CERTIFIED!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong><br>Welcome to <i>Forklift Certified</i>, a unique single-player 3D top-down puzzle experience where you can kick back, unwind, and enjoy clever challenges at your own pace. Take control of a forklift to navigate intricate puzzles, activate mechanisms, and conquer challenges in 10 handcrafted levels, each set in a distinct and creative environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Engaging Forklift-Based Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your forklift to interact with the environment: activate buttons, flip switches, and deliver puzzle pieces to their correct locations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>10 Handcrafted Levels Across Unique Locations</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles in diverse environments, from an industrial trainyard to the relaxing farm, through a mysterious dungeon, and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Exciting Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time Trial Mode:</strong> Race against the clock to beat bronze, silver, or gold times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuel Mode:</strong> Keep your forklift running by collecting gas cans as you navigate each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Limited Pickup Mode:</strong> The forklift's hydraulics are running low, limiting the number of objects you can pick up per level. Strategize carefully!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc4 <strong>Find the Certification Manual Pages</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level features a hidden certification manual page waiting to be discovered.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f <strong>Certifications</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your progress and achievements with a variety of certifications to complete. Can you become fully forklift certified?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Custom Forklift Skins</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and equip a variety of fun and quirky forklift designs to personalize your ride.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Immersive Audio &amp; Visuals</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cel-shaded graphics and a dynamic soundtrack that create a calming and engaging atmosphere.</p></li></ul>",
